Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:56:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2935/3799] soh: rename func_80B40CBC -> EnXc_NextAfterAction68

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the same guard from action 68 to 69
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
index 79bb24717..3193e7f34 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
@@ -2012,7 +2012,8 @@ void EnXc_NextAfterAction67(EnXc* this) {
     EnXc_CheckAndSetAction(this, SHEIK_ACTION_67, SHEIK_ACTION_68);
 }
 
-void func_80B40CBC(EnXc* this) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B40CBC: the same guard from action 68 to 69
+void EnXc_NextAfterAction68(EnXc* this) {
     EnXc_CheckAndSetAction(this, SHEIK_ACTION_68, SHEIK_ACTION_69);
 }
 
@@ -2188,7 +2189,7 @@ void EnXc_ActionFunc67(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
 
 void EnXc_ActionFunc68(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
     EnXc_ActionFunc9(this, play);
-    func_80B40CBC(this);
+    EnXc_NextAfterAction68(this);  // was func_80B40CBC [LLM:HIGH]
 }
 
 void EnXc_ActionFunc69(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
